$ cadence projects edit --project alpha --if-match 3 --body {"name":"Alpha 2"}
exit 0
--- requests
PATCH /api/projects/alpha
  header Authorization: Bearer cdk_env
  header Idempotency-Key: key-0001
  header If-Match: "3"
  header Content-Type: application/json
  header Accept: application/json
  body {"name":"Alpha 2"}
--- stdout
{
  "ok": true
}
--- stderr
